'''Growing Epic''' is a [[Catfruit]] gathering event that appears for 3 hours each on Saturdays and Sundays. It was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] and is unlocked after clearing [[An Ancient Curse]]. The first stage yields an [[Catfruit|Epic Catfruit]], while the second stage drops an Epic Catfruit Seed. Both stages are '''Deadly'''.

