'''Notes:'''
*After completing the first stage, the player has a 40% chance to proceed to a [[Continuation Stage]].
*Since the second stage is a Continuation Stage, it is impossible to use [[Battle Items]] (except Speed Ups) in the second. The player also cannot change their lineup between stages.

